@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "Angular Frontend\nwhisper-wall" as FE
component "Router Pages" as RP
component "Api Service" as API
component "Django REST API\nwhisperwall" as BE
component "Token Auth" as AUTH
component "Matching Engine\n(model save + find_matches)" as MATCH
database "SQLite\ndb.sqlite3" as DB
component "Browser Storage\nlocalStorage" as LS
component "SSR Node Server" as SSR

FE --> RP
FE --> API
FE --> LS
SSR --> FE
API --> BE : HTTP /api
BE --> AUTH
BE --> MATCH
BE --> DB
MATCH --> DB
AUTH --> DB
BE --> DB

note right of API
Adds Authorization: Token <key>
for authenticated requests.
end note

note bottom of MATCH
Creates Match and Event records
when a new confession is saved.
end note

@enduml
